%% Diagram source: docs/diagram/architecture.mmd
flowchart TB
  classDef core stroke-width:3px
  classDef boundary stroke-dasharray: 4 3
  classDef cmux stroke-width:3px,stroke-dasharray: 2 2

  subgraph Pi[Pi process]
    direction LR
    Lifecycle[Pi lifecycle] --> Hooks[Hooks]
    Events[Process-local events<br/>update / remove / ready] --> Hooks
  end

  Hooks --> Runtime[PresenceRuntime]

  subgraph Flow[Presence pipeline]
    direction LR
    Validate[Strict validation<br/>retained state / todo / usage] --> Present[Presentation]
    Target[Identity + socket<br/>validation] --> Client[PresenceClient]
    Present --> Client
  end
  Runtime --> Validate
  Runtime --> Target

  subgraph Delivery[cmux output]
    direction LR
    V1[Configuration gate<br/>V1 status / progress / log] --> Transport[Serial UnixSocketTransport]
    V2[Exact V2 capability gate<br/>optional methods only] --> Transport
    Drop[Drop / disable output]
  end
  Client --> V1
  Client --> V2
  Transport -->|socket only| Cmux[cmux]

  Runtime -. best-effort failures<br/>never interrupt Pi work .-> Drop
  Client -. best-effort failures .-> Drop

  class Runtime,Validate,Present,Client core
  class Events,Hooks,Target,Transport,Drop boundary
  class Cmux cmux
